# Calculator API: ready-to-run requests for the VS Code REST Client extension
# and the JetBrains HTTP client. Click "Send Request" above any block.
# Point @baseUrl at another instance if needed (the Vite dev server on
# http://localhost:5173 proxies /api to the Go server as well).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check: 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### The OpenAPI 3.1 contract the binary was built with (application/yaml)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/openapi.yaml

### Add: 0.1 + 0.2 is rounded to 12 significant digits, so the result is 0.3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "add", "a": 0.1, "b": 0.2}

### Square root uses only "a": {"result":4}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "sqrt", "a": 16}

### Percent is "a percent of b": 15% of 200 is {"result":30}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "percent", "a": 15, "b": 200}

### Division by zero: 422 DIVISION_BY_ZERO
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "divide", "a": 1, "b": 0}

### Unknown operation: 400 INVALID_OPERATION (the message lists the valid ones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "modulo", "a": 1, "b": 2}

### Wrong method: 405 METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED with an Allow: POST header
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate

### Malformed body: 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation": "add",

### Custom request ID: echoed in X-Request-Id and in error.requestId, and logged
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: my-trace-123

{"operation": "divide", "a": 1, "b": 0}
